<span id="Introduction"></span>
== Въведение ==

{{TOCright}}

В FreeCAD думата "[[Sketch/bg|Скица]]" обикновено се използва за обозначаване на [[Sketcher_SketchObject|Sketcher SketchObject]] ({{incode|Sketcher::SketchObject}} клас), който се определя от [[Sketcher_Workbench/bg|Работна маса Sketcher]]. Това е 2D чертеж, който използва математически ограничения, за да опише точно 2D геометрия.

Вижте [[Sketcher_SketchObject|Sketcher SketchObject]] за повече информация относно този тип обект.

<span id="Usage"></span>
==Използване==

There are two common ways to create a Sketch: using the [[Sketcher_Workbench|Sketcher Workbench]] directly, or through the [[PartDesign_Workbench|PartDesign Workbench]].

=== Sketcher Workbench ===

# Switch to the [[Image:Workbench_Sketcher.svg|16px]] [[Sketcher Workbench|Sketcher Workbench]].
# Press {{Button|[[File:Sketcher_NewSketch.svg|16px]] [[Sketcher_NewSketch|New Sketch]]}}.

=== PartDesign Workbench ===

# Switch to the [[Image:Workbench_PartDesign.svg|16px]] [[PartDesign Workbench|PartDesign Workbench]].
# Press {{Button|[[File:PartDesign_Body.svg|16px]] [[PartDesign_Body|New Body]]}}.
# Press {{Button|[[File:PartDesign_NewSketch.svg|16px]] [[PartDesign_NewSketch|New Sketch]]}}.

After you finish editing the sketch, close it to go out of edit mode. Double click on it to enter edit mode again.

== Notes ==

A Sketch is very commonly used in conjunction with the [[File:Workbench_PartDesign.svg|16px]] [[PartDesign_Workbench|PartDesign Workbench]] to create solids by extrusion, using the [[File:PartDesign Pad.svg|16px]] [[PartDesign_Pad|PartDesign Pad]] operation.

Nevertheless, a Sketch can always be created by itself for any other purpose; it does not have to be tied to a [[PartDesign_Body|PartDesign Body]]. For example, the [[File:Arch_Window.svg|16px]] [[Arch_Window|Arch Window]] tool of the [[File:Workbench_BIM.svg|16px]] [[BIM_Workbench|BIM Workbench]] uses Sketches to define the shapes of windows and doors; in the same way, they can be used to define the shape of [[File:Arch_Wall.svg|16px]] [[Arch_Wall|Arch Walls]].


